{"title":"Career Roadmap · Economic Analyst","role":"Economic Analyst","summary":"An Economic Analyst studies economic conditions, markets, industries, businesses, government policies, and financial data to identify trends and support decisions. The role combines economics, statistics, data analysis, research, financial markets, and communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Applied Economics / Financial Economics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Economics + mathematics + Excel + statistics"}],[{"text":"Applied Skills"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Econometrics + SQL + Python/R + research"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Financial economics + forecasting + projects"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Research/Economic/Business Analyst"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Economic Analyst / Senior Analyst"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"7–12 years"},{"text":"Economist / Economic Consultant / Research Manager"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"12–20 years"},{"text":"Principal Economist / Research Director / Chief Economist-track"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"20+ years"},{"text":"Economic Policy, Research, Consulting or Institutional Leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Economics + Quantitative Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Indian economy"},{"text":"Mathematical economics"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Public finance"},{"text":"Financial economics fundamentals"},{"text":"Economic history"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"P