"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"RStudio"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"}]}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After the BA, possible entry roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Economic Analyst"},{"text":"Economic Research Analyst"},{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Research Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Market Research Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Policy Research Assistant"},{"text":"Economic Research Assistant"},{"text":"Investment Research Associate"},{"text":"Credit Research Analyst"},{"text":"Market Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Economic Data Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interview Questions"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect questions such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What causes inflation?"},{"text":"How does monetary policy affect economic growth?"},{"text":"What is the difference between nominal and real GDP?"},{"text":"What happens when interest rates increase?"},{"text":"Explain fiscal vs monetary policy."},{"text":"What is elasticity?"},{"text":"Correlation vs causation?"},{"text":"What is multicollinearity?"},{"text":"What does an R-squared value tell you?"},{"text":"How would you forecast GDP?"},{"text":"How would you analyse a country's economic outlook?"},{"text":"How would you evaluate a government policy?"},{"text":"Write an SQL query to calculate monthly economic indicators."},{"text":"How would you clean an economic dataset?"},{"text":"Explain one economic trend using data."}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a long-term Economist/Economic Analyst career, postgraduate study is highly valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Master's Degrees"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Economics"},{"text":"MSc Economics"},{"text":"MSc Applied Economics"},{"text":"MSc Financial Economics"},{"text":"MSc Econometrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quanti